  "description": "Production of pure crystals from solution by controlled supersaturation via cooling, evaporation, or antisolvent addition. Three designs: cooling batch crystallizer (steep solubility curves), forced-circulation evaporative (flat curves, continuous), and draft-tube baffle with fines destruction (narrow size distribution). Primary purification method for solid chemical products including salts, fertilizers, and pharmaceuticals.",
